#: includes/trait-wp-document-revisions-admin-editor.php:748
msgid "Basic Usage"
msgstr "Grundlæggende brug"

#: includes/trait-wp-document-revisions-admin-editor.php:749
msgid ""
"This screen allows users to collaboratively edit documents and track their "
"revision history. To begin, enter a title for the document, optionally enter"
" a description, and click <code>Upload New Version</code> and select the "
"file from your computer."
msgstr ""
"Denne skærm giver brugerne mulighed for at redigere dokumenter i fællesskab "
"og spore deres revisionshistorik. For at starte skal du indtaste en titel "
"til dokumentet, eventuelt indtaste en beskrivelse, klikke på <code>Upload ny"
" version</code> og vælge filen fra din computer."

#: includes/trait-wp-document-revisions-admin-editor.php:750
msgid ""
"Once successfully uploaded, you can enter a revision log message, assign the"
" document an author, and describe its current workflow state."
msgstr ""
"Når uploaden er vellykket, kan du indtaste en revisionslogmeddelelse, "
"tildele dokumentet en forfatter og beskrive dets aktuelle "
"arbejdsgangsstatus."

#: includes/trait-wp-document-revisions-admin-editor.php:751
msgid "When done, simply click <code>Update</code> to save your changes"
msgstr ""
"Når du er færdig, skal du blot klikke på <code>Opdater</code> for at gemme "
"dine ændringer"

#: includes/trait-wp-document-revisions-admin-editor.php:752
#: includes/trait-wp-document-revisions-admin-editor.php:822
msgid "Document Description"
msgstr "Dokumentbeskrivelse"

#: includes/trait-wp-document-revisions-admin-editor.php:753
msgid ""
"The document description provides a short user-oriented summary of the "
"document."
msgstr ""
"Dokumentets beskrivelse giver et kort brugerorienteret sammendrag af "
"dokumentet."

#: includes/trait-wp-document-revisions-admin-editor.php:754
msgid ""
"This can be used with the Document List or Latest Documents blocks or their "
"shortcode or widget equivalents."
msgstr ""
"Dette kan bruges med blokkene Dokumentliste eller Seneste dokumenter eller "
"deres shortcode- eller widget-ækvivalenter."

#: includes/trait-wp-document-revisions-admin-editor.php:756
msgid ""
"The revision log provides a short summary of the changes reflected in a "
"particular revision. Used widely in the open-source community, it provides a"
" comprehensive history of the document at a glance."
msgstr ""
"Revisionsloggen giver et kort resumé af de ændringer, der afspejles i en "
"bestemt revision. Den bruges bredt i open source-fællesskabet og giver et "
"overblik over dokumentets omfattende historik."

#: includes/trait-wp-document-revisions-admin-editor.php:757
msgid ""
"You can download and view previous versions of the document by clicking the "
"timestamp in the revision log. You can also restore revisions by clicking "
"the <code>restore</code> button beside the revision."
msgstr ""
"Du kan downloade og se tidligere versioner af dokumentet ved at klikke på "
"tidsstemplet i revisionsloggen. Du kan også gendanne revisioner ved at "
"klikke på knappen <code>gendan</code> ved siden af revisionen."

#: includes/trait-wp-document-revisions-admin-editor.php:759
msgid ""
"The workflow state field can be used to help team members understand at what"
" stage a document sits within a particular organization&quot;s workflow. The"
" field is optional, and can be customized or queried by clicking "
"<code>Workflow States</code> on the left-hand side."
msgstr ""
"Feltet Workflowstatus kan bruges til at hjælpe teammedlemmer med at forstå, "
"på hvilket stadie et dokument befinder sig i en bestemt organisations "
"arbejdsgang. Feltet er valgfrit og kan tilpasses eller forespørges ved at "
"klikke på <code>Workflowstatus</code> i venstre side."

#: includes/trait-wp-document-revisions-admin-editor.php:760
msgid "Publishing Documents"
msgstr "Udgivelse af dokumenter"

#: includes/trait-wp-document-revisions-admin-editor.php:761
msgid ""
"By default, uploaded documents are only accessible to logged in users. "
"Documents can be published, thus making them accessible to the world, by "
"toggling their visibility in the \"Publish\" box in the top right corner. "
"Any document marked as published will be accessible to anyone with the "
"proper URL."
msgstr ""
"Som standard er uploadede dokumenter kun tilgængelige for brugere, der er "
"logget ind. Dokumenter kan publiceres, og dermed gøres tilgængelige for hele"
" verden, ved at slå deres synlighed til/fra i feltet \"Udgiv\" i øverste "
"højre hjørne. Ethvert dokument, der er markeret som publiceret, vil være "
"tilgængeligt for alle med den korrekte URL."

#: includes/trait-wp-document-revisions-admin-editor.php:765
msgid ""
"Below is a list of all documents to which you have access. Click the "
"document title to edit the document or download the latest version."
msgstr ""
"Nedenfor er en liste over alle dokumenter, du har adgang til. Klik på "
"dokumenttitlen for at redigere dokumentet eller downloade den seneste "
"version."

#: includes/trait-wp-document-revisions-admin-editor.php:766
msgid ""
"To add a new document, click <strong>Add Document</strong> on the left-hand "
"side."
msgstr ""
"For at tilføje et nyt dokument skal du klikke på <strong>Tilføj "
"dokument</strong> i venstre side."

#: includes/trait-wp-document-revisions-admin-editor.php:767
msgid ""
"To view all documents at a particular workflow state, click <strong>Workflow"
" States</strong> in the menu on the left."
msgstr ""
"For at se alle dokumenter i en bestemt arbejdsgangstilstand skal du klikke "
"på <strong>Arbejdsgangstilstande</strong> i menuen til venstre."

#: includes/trait-wp-document-revisions-admin-editor.php:955
#: includes/trait-wp-document-revisions-admin-editor.php:963
msgid "You do not have the upload_files capability!"
msgstr "Du har ikke upload_files-funktionen!"

#: includes/trait-wp-document-revisions-admin-editor.php:957
msgid ""
"You will not be able to upload documents though you may be able change some "
"attributes."
msgstr ""
"Du vil ikke kunne uploade dokumenter, men du kan muligvis ændre nogle "
"attributter."

#: includes/trait-wp-document-revisions-admin-editor.php:965
msgid "You will not be able to upload any documents."
msgstr "Du vil ikke kunne uploade nogen dokumenter."

#: includes/trait-wp-document-revisions-admin-editor.php:981
msgid ""
"Revision summaries are optional notes to store along with this revision that"
" allow other users to quickly and easily see what changes you made without "
"needing to open the actual file."
msgstr ""
"Revisionsresuméer er valgfrie noter, der kan gemmes sammen med denne "
"revision, og som giver andre brugere mulighed for hurtigt og nemt at se, "
"hvilke ændringer du har foretaget, uden at skulle åbne selve filen."

